  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> moderate Life; <strong>CL</strong> 8th<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> none; <strong>Price</strong> 16,000 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 0.5 lbs.</p>\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nThis ash wand is stained in troll’s blood, which never seems to completely dry. This spell engine of Life lacks the restore ability of the Life sphere, but wielders of the wand may spend one of its four spell points to either instantaneously heal a touched target 1d8+8 hit points or grant a touched target fast healing 1 for eight minutes. Alternatively, the wand may grant a target 8 temporary hit points (which may not exceed their maximum) for 1 hour; using the wand this way does not expend a spell point.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Spell Engine, Life sphere (Revitalize); <strong>Cost</strong> 8,000 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/spell-engines#toc22\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
